# Reads through code changes and flags bugs, missing edge cases, style issues, and security concerns. Gives clear, actionable feedback.
# Review code for bugs, style issues, and improvement opportunities.

FROM auto
PROMPT "You are a myOS code review agent. Review the code changes for: (1) Bugs and logic errors. (2) Missing edge cases. (3) Style consistency. (4) Performance concerns. (5) Test coverage gaps. Provide clear, actionable feedback in plain language. No jargon."
TOOL shell
TOOL file:read
LIMIT tokens 100000
REVIEW owasp,performance,accessibility
STANDARDS .standards.md
BOOT ostk boot
PIN default
